# Software industry mapping for ITSM
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/itsm/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:production_incident owl:equivalentClass sw:ProductionIncident .
legacy:production_incident_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:productionIncidentId .
legacy:software_configuration_item owl:equivalentClass sw:SoftwareConfigurationItem .
legacy:software_configuration_item_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:softwareConfigurationItemId .
legacy:affects_software_configuration_item rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:affectsSoftwareConfigurationItem .
